# Path redirects (Cloudflare Workers `_redirects`). Old site URLs that point at
# a section of the home page are redirect pages in src/pages/[...redirect].astro
# instead, because a URL fragment can't be written here.

# GitHub Pages project sites. While alxjrvs.com was served by GitHub Pages,
# every repo's Pages site also appeared under it (alxjrvs.com/boom/…). They
# live on at alxjrvs.github.io/<repo>/ once the custom domain is removed from
# this repo's Pages settings.
/boom            https://alxjrvs.github.io/boom/ 301
/butter          https://alxjrvs.github.io/butter/ 301
/ajarcomic       https://alxjrvs.github.io/ajarcomic/ 301
/FulcrumWorks    https://alxjrvs.github.io/FulcrumWorks/ 301
/vellum          https://alxjrvs.github.io/vellum/ 301
/boom/*          https://alxjrvs.github.io/boom/:splat          301
/butter/*        https://alxjrvs.github.io/butter/:splat        301
/ajarcomic/*     https://alxjrvs.github.io/ajarcomic/:splat     301
/FulcrumWorks/*  https://alxjrvs.github.io/FulcrumWorks/:splat  301
/vellum/*        https://alxjrvs.github.io/vellum/:splat        301
